{
  "schema": "nexloop-ci-stages/1",
  "version": 4,
  "decision": "As v3 (D-j 2026-10-11), with every test stage run to the end (dispatcher 2026-10-11: integration-parallel carries the known class B failures every round, so the stages after it never ran and no pi.xml or runtime.xml was ever produced). Preparation stages (dependencies, static checks, licenses, builds) still stop the run at their first failure; every test stage (unit-contract, serial-build, deadline-gate, integration-parallel, integration-heavy, pi-runtime, and any test stage added later) has stop_on_failure false and writes its own JUnit. The trusted judgement is per stage and per suite, independent of order: a failed stage, a missing suite, or any failed, errored or skipped test in a suite fails the result. scripts/ci/check follows the same rule: its exit status is that of the first failing test stage, and it prints one line per stage (NEXLOOP-STAGE name=<stage> rc=<status> seconds=<elapsed> junit=<files>). Required suites as v3 (required-suites.v2.json, count groups). The baseline rule of v3 is unchanged: a case leaves the baseline after two consecutive full runs pass in its assigned stage; a class C case that fails two consecutive full runs is raised to class B or A; a case with a violation assertion is class A on any violation.",
  "stages": [
    {
      "name": "dependency-python",
      "network": "dependency",
      "argv": [
        "bash",
        "scripts/ci/stages/dependency-python.sh"
      ],
      "timeout_seconds": 1800
    },
    {
      "name": "static",
      "network": "test",
      "argv": [
        "bash",
        "scripts/ci/stages/static.sh"
      ],
      "timeout_seconds": 900,
      "env": {
        "UV_OFFLINE": "1",
        "npm_config_offline": "true"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "dependency-node",
      "network": "dependency",
      "argv": [
        "bash",
        "scripts/ci/stages/dependency-node.sh"
      ],
      "timeout_seconds": 1800
    },
    {
      "name": "licenses",
      "network": "test",
      "argv": [
        "bash",
        "scripts/ci/stages/licenses.sh"
      ],
      "timeout_seconds": 300,
      "env": {
        "UV_OFFLINE": "1",
        "npm_config_offline": "true"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "build-artifacts",
      "network": "test",
      "argv": [
        "bash",
        "scripts/ci/stages/build-artifacts.sh"
      ],
      "timeout_seconds": 1800,
